                "Given in memory of Valerie Orr" ;
        ecrm:P24_transferred_title_of  <http://data.silknow.org/object/03d33eb0-ab4a-3b8b-8a88-b4976994c950> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Donated by Peter Orr in 2016, who was given the samplers by his mother Valerie Orr (deceased). The donor advised that his mother acquired the samplers over several years as she was the Chair of the Embroiderers' Guild in Yorkshire. He believes the period of acquisition would have been 1970-2005, and that a number were donated by a good friend in the 1970's, whilst others were purchased or a gift from others."@en .

